@startuml BatterySwapReservation
!theme plain
title Battery Swap Reservation and Swap Service — Business Process

|== PHASE 1: DISCOVERY ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Search nearby swap stations|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Query stations by location\nReturn: stations + availability + price|

|== PHASE 2: RESERVATION ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Reserve a slot at station|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Allocate available slot|
:Create reservation (UNPAID)|
:Update slot status → RESERVED|

|== PHASE 3: PAYMENT ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Make payment|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Confirm payment → PAID|

|== PHASE 4: ARRIVAL ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Confirm arrival at station|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Start 15-minute hold timer|

|== PHASE 5: SWAP START ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Request to start swap|
|#LightYellow|② System|
if (Payment done\n+ arrived on time?) is (No)
  :Reject request|
  stop
else (Yes)
endif
:Generate swap code|
:Broadcast code to Hardware Simulator|
:Reservation status → SWAPPING|

|== PHASE 6: PHYSICAL SWAP ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Present code at station|

|#GhostWhite|③ Station Operator|
:Verify code + perform battery swap|

|#GhostWhite|③ Station Operator|
:Confirm swap completion|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Validate code|
if (Code valid?) is (No)
  :Reject|
  stop
else (Yes)
endif
:Swap batteries\n(swap out depleted → charge\nassign fresh → user)|
:Complete reservation|
:Award loyalty points (+50)|
:Mark eligible for rating|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Swap complete notification|

stop

|== CANCELLATION ==|

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User|
:Cancel reservation|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Release slot|
:Refund if paid|
:Update status → CANCELLED|
stop

|== EXPIRATION (Background) ==|

|#LightYellow|② System|
:Background jobs expire:\n• Unpaid reservations (30 min)\n• Unclaimed slots (15 min hold)\n• Expired swap codes (30 min)|
:Release slot + update status → EXPIRED|
stop

@enduml
